<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on June 12.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on June 12.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				 June 12		June 11</p>
<p>Fed acct			 4.280		  4.776</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	   7.875		  9.616</p>
<p>Cash balance		  12.155		 14.392</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,266.398	     5,269.270</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $5 million were issued and $64 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
</text>
